name: local/self-whitelist
description: Never ban this VPS; site SSR and deploy health probes reach its own routes through Cloudflare
whitelist:
  reason: own public IP (frontend SSR 404 lookups and deploy probes looked like http-probing)
  ip:
{% for host in groups['edge'] %}
    - "{{ hostvars[host].edge_ip }}"
{% endfor %}
